# The hero's face under the player's live voice (reports/content/2026-11-hero-head/player-voice-face.md, step 1): the hero
# with an own head says four phrases of the user through the AI server as the microphone (`ptt`: the server's
# --voice-files plays the recording in real time and streams it back as ptt_audio, v64), close up in Xardas' tower of
# the default save. Then Xardas' voice from the speakers in the microphone: his line DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_14_00 plays
# in the game while the microphone hears it 12 dB below the hero's voice and the hero's phrase over it from 5 s on -
# first without ducking (LiveDuck 0), then as it is. Last the hero says two lines of his original voice on the same
# head, the mouth of a recorded voice to compare with. The recordings lie in /tmp/player-voice/
# on the machine of the game and of the server (phrase-1..4.wav, npc-mix.wav: 16 kHz mono, not in git).
# Needs an AI server with --voice-files and an ASR service; the server's --no-player-face films "было" (the mouth
# still). How to run it and make the clip - scripts/bench/README.md, "Player voice clip".
# @timeout 300
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean 30
overlay off
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 110 0
wait 800
watch player
cam face 38 0 1
wait 1500
rec voice
wait 700
ptt /tmp/player-voice/phrase-1.wav
wait 900
ptt /tmp/player-voice/phrase-2.wav
wait 900
ptt /tmp/player-voice/phrase-3.wav
wait 900
ptt /tmp/player-voice/phrase-4.wav
wait 1000
stop
lips param LiveDuck 0
rec npc0
wait 500
speak nearest DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_14_00
ptt /tmp/player-voice/npc-mix.wav
wait 1500
stop
lips param LiveDuck 18
rec npc
wait 500
speak nearest DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_14_00
ptt /tmp/player-voice/npc-mix.wav
wait 1500
stop
rec own
wait 700
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_15_01 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 5000
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_AddonSuccess_15_00 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 4800
stop
